The '''Time Machine''' is one of the [[Into the Future]] [[Treasure]]s. It allows the player to regain [[Cat Energy|energy]] faster.

==Effect==
Each Time Machine reduces [[Cat Energy|energy]] recovery time by 10 seconds per energy.

When a player's Time Machines are 100% in all three chapters, Energy recovery time is reduced by 30 seconds per energy.

<sub>i.e. 1 Energy / min becomes 1 Energy / 30 sec or 2 Energy / min</sub>

