==Trivia==
*The Time Machine's overall design references the DeLorean DMC-12 Time Machine featured in ''[[wikipedia:Back to the Future Part II|Back to the Future Part II]]'', evident from its gull-wing doors, its rear thrusters, its rotated wheels and implication of flight capability.
*In spite of being listed 10th in the Treasure menu, the Time Machine is actually the third Into the Future Treasure the player can activate.

